      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْغُوفٌ</span></b>  <i>Insane,</i> or <i>mad;</i> (O, K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْعُوفٌ</span>.
(O.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْغُوفٌ بِمَالٍ</span> One <i>to whom property
is embellished</i> [or <i>rendered pleasing,</i>] <i>so that he
loves it.</i> (Msb.)

